{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "2CO",
  "chapter": 11,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Would that ye could bear with me in a little foolishness: but indeed ye do bear with me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I am jealous over you with a godly jealousy: for I espoused you to one husband, that I might present you ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a pure virgin to Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I fear, lest by any means, as the serpent beguiled Eve in his craftiness, your minds should be corrupted from the simplicity and the purity that is toward Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For if he that cometh preacheth another Jesus, whom we did not preach, or ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "if",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ye receive a different spirit, which ye did not receive, or a different gospel, which ye did not accept, ye do well to bear with ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I reckon that I am not a whit behind the very chiefest apostles.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But though ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "I be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " rude in speech, yet ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am I",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not in knowledge; nay, in every way have we made ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "this",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " manifest unto you in all things.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Or did I commit a sin in abasing myself that ye might be exalted, because I preached to you the gospel of God for nought?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I robbed other churches, taking wages ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " that I might minister unto you;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "and when I was present with you and was in want, I was not a burden on any man; for the brethren, when they came from Macedonia, supplied the measure of my want; and in everything I kept myself from being burdensome unto you, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " will I keep ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "myself",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As the truth of Christ is in me, no man shall stop me of this glorying in the regions of Achaia.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore? because I love you not? God knoweth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But what I do, that I will do, that I may cut off occasion from them that desire an occasion; that wherein they glory, they may be found even as we.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For such men are false apostles, deceitful workers, fashioning themselves into apostles of Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And no marvel; for even Satan fashioneth himself into an angel of light.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It is no great thing therefore if his ministers also fashion themselves as ministers of righteousness; whose end shall be according to their works.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I say again, Let no man think me foolish; but if ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "ye do",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", yet as foolish receive me, that I also may glory a little.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That which I speak, I speak not after the Lord, but as in foolishness, in this confidence of glorying.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Seeing that many glory after the flesh, I will glory also.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For ye bear with the foolish gladly, being wise ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "yourselves",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For ye bear with a man, if he bringeth you into bondage, if he devoureth you, if he taketh you ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "captive",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", if he exalteth himself, if he smiteth you on the face.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I speak by way of disparagement, as though we had been weak. Yet whereinsoever any is bold (I speak in foolishness), I am bold also.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Are they Hebrews? so am I. Are they Israelites? so am I. Are they the seed of Abraham? so am I.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Are they ministers of Christ? (I speak as one beside himself) I more; in labors more abundantly, in prisons more abundantly, in stripes above measure, in deaths oft.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Of the Jews five times received I forty ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "stripes",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " save one.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thrice was I beaten with rods, once was I stoned, thrice I suffered shipwreck, a night and a day have I been in the deep;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " journeyings often, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " perils of rivers, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " perils of robbers, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " perils from ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "my",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " countrymen, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " perils from the Gentiles, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " perils in the city, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " perils in the wilderness, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " perils in the sea, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " perils among false brethren;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " labor and travail, in watchings often, in hunger and thirst, in fastings often, in cold and nakedness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Besides those things that are without, there is that which presseth upon me daily, anxiety for all the churches.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who is weak, and I am not weak? who is caused to stumble, and I burn not?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If I must needs glory, I will glory of the things that concern my weakness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The God and Father of the Lord Jesus, he who is blessed for evermore knoweth that I lie not.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In Damascus the governor under Aretas the king guarded the city of the Damascenes in order to take me:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.11.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:2CO.11.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "and through a window was I let down in a basket by the wall, and escaped his hands.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
